Dragon Burst (2026-10-28): the Burst Limit diagnostics only with the draw log.

[db-decl] (registered declarations, the declaration each vertex shader draws with) and [db-tex] (guest formats first
sampled) log only with banjo_renut_diag_draw_log_s, as [db-ramp] and the c255 lines already did: the normal path
logs none of them and skips the per-draw set lookup. The unregistered-declaration warning stays. With the draw
log on, the first draw of each pixel shader is logged too (a census, for effects that come and go).

